{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can an older brother go when faced with the fear of losing the last remaining member of his family?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leia's 12th birthday turned into a nightmare when masked, unidentified individuals kidnapped her. Following the traces, Vincent and his childhood friend Antonio arrive at an abandoned mansion, where they run across something they never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ending up in a place thick with bloodthirsty creatures and unknowns aside, Leia is nowhere to be seen. Vincent has to not only survive here, but also find his sister. And just how far is he willing to go to save her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897120/extras/9869dfd7129ef12a23ba9ae6f1fd6b39.avif?t=1755052779\" width=700 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself with a responsive, action-based combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak past monsters and stay hidden to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime of 6-8 hours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations and contents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and connect with characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn each monster's playstyle and find a way to defeat them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve diverse puzzles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897120?t=1755052779","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897120?t=1755052779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897120/f0fb451bdb05fc4971e36d1e5f64c549648b3f2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755052779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897120/f0fb451bdb05fc4971e36d1e5f64c549648b3f2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755052779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How far can an older brother go when faced with the fear of losing the last remaining member of his family?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Leia's 12th birthday turned into a nightmare when masked, unidentified individuals kidnapped her. Following the traces, Vincent and his childhood friend Antonio arrive at an abandoned mansion, where they run across something they never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ending up in a place thick with bloodthirsty creatures and unknowns aside, Leia is nowhere to be seen. Vincent has to not only survive here, but also find his sister. And just how far is he willing to go to save her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897120/extras/9869dfd7129ef12a2